<title>UK: SEK sets 10 billion peseta 15-year matador bond.</title>
<headline>SEK sets 10 billion peseta 15-year matador bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN ESP    COUPON     3.75	MATURITY   *27.FEB.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.625   PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
